 add('P12BC-STOP','源码/时延小不替代完整非干扰验收','experimental_design','P12b/P12c','8 and10 preparatory starts; no formal',False,'old frozen off/on scales applied only to that question',['docs/THOR_P12B_REPORT.md','docs/THOR_P12C_REPORT.md'],'off/on state/cache confounding; dynamic disagreement is not proven observation causality; P13 fixed-platform scope distinct','OLD_NOT_PASSED_UNCHANGED')
